<title>UK: UK March non-EU trade deficit 606 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK March non-EU trade deficit 606 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics released following seasonally adjusted UK non-EU Trade data-</p>
<p>    UK TRADE NON-EU (in million stg)    March    Feb   (prev est)</p>
<p>    Trade balance			 -606    -437    (-554)</p>
<p>    Exports (FOB)			 5,780    6,198 (6,244)</p>
<p>    Imports (FOB)			 6,386    6,635 (6,798)</p>
<p>    Oil exports			     192	220   (220)</p>
<p>    Oil imports			     282	338   (337)</p>
<p>    Trade balance 3m ending	   -1,334     n/a(-1,512)</p>
<p>NOTE - forecast 613 million stg deficit.  </p>
<p>TRADE VOLUME EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Import volume index (base 1990) 142.1    145.3    (146.1)</p>
<p>    Export volume index (base 1990) 137.6    143.4    (144.5)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)  -0.5%    1.0%     (1.5%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (imps)   3.0%    5.5%     (6.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   5.5%    1.5%     (2.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (exps)  11.0%    9.0%     (9.5%)</p>
<p>TRADE VALUE EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Balance (million stg)		    -355    -172    (-268)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)  -3.0%   -1.5%   (-0.5%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   3.0%    0.5%   (1.0%)</p>
</text>
